{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"select"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"sectionNamed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"name","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The section or subsection name to select."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The name is compared with the names shown in the section and subsection"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ribbons, ignoring case and whitespace, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"backissues"},{"type":"text","text":" selects a section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"named “Back Issues”. A subsection’s name selects its section and that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subsection, as does the section’s name followed by the subsection’s with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slash between ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"backissues\/sunday"},{"type":"text","text":"). In a kiosk section the same form names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one of its publications ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supplements\/magazine"},{"type":"text","text":"), whose archive opens over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kiosk once its tiles have loaded. A name that matches nothing leaves the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel where it is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this at any time: a selection made before the carousel is on screen is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applied once it appears, so a host can hand a deep link straight to it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The subsections of a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController\/SectionItem\/dynamicArchive(_:shortcode:config:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are known only once it has loaded, so a name among them matches only after that."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/carouselviewcontroller\/select(sectionnamed:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController\/select(sectionNamed:)"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"select"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"sectionNamed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"select(sectionNamed:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"PSReader"}],"externalID":"s:8PSReader22CarouselViewControllerC6select12sectionNamedySS_tF","symbolKind":"method"},"abstract":[{"text":"Moves the carousel to the section, or the subsection, with the given name.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/